{"text": "E Bike City Tour. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Explore the citys hidden spots. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On an E Bike. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Schedule Meeting Site. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Schedule, Every Saturday. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At 10 a, m. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Meeting Site, Riverside Park North Entrance. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Program Details. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Safety training on braking and signaling. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> 30 mins. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Guided group tour along the city path. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> 1 hour. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Participation Requirements. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Age, Must be 16 years or older. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Valid ID required. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Maximum Speed, 30 km h. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> $25 per person. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> 10% off the total. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For groups of 4 or more. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Full refund if canceled. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> 2 days before the tour. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But non refundable after that.", "alignment": {"characters": ["E", " ", "B", "i", "k", "e", " ", "C", "i", "t", "y", " ", "T", "o", "u", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "E", "x", "p", "l", "o", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "i", "t", "y", "s", " ", "h", "i", "d", "d", "e", "n", " ", "s", "p", "o", "t", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "n", " ", "a", "n", " ", "E", " ", "B", "i", "k", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "c", "h", "e", "d", "u", "l", "e", " ", "M", "e", "e", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "S", "i", "t", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "c", "h",